Here is a complete, single-file solution. It includes a robust code editor engine (using Prism.js for highlighting), a file system manager, a theme switcher, a word counter, and a "Dark Mode" aesthetic.  Save this code as `index.html` and open it in any modern browser.  ```html <!DOCTYPE html> <html lang="en"> <head>     <meta charset="UTF-8">     <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">     <title>DevNote Pro - Advanced Notepad</title>          <!-- PrismJS for Syntax Highlighting -->     <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/themes/prism-tomorrow.min.css" rel="stylesheet" />     <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/plugins/line-numbers/prism-line-numbers.min.css" rel="stylesheet" />     <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">      <style>         :root {             --bg-color: #1e1e1e;             --sidebar-bg: #252526;             --text-color: #d4d4d4;             --accent-color: #007acc;             --border-color: #3e3e42;             --tab-active-bg: #1e1e1e;             --tab-inactive-bg: #2d2d2d;             --tab-text: #969696;             --tab-text-active: #ffffff;             --scrollbar-bg: #1e1e1e;             --scrollbar-thumb: #424242;         }          /* Light Theme Variables */         [data-theme="light"] {             --bg-color: #ffffff;             --sidebar-bg: #f3f3f3;             --text-color: #333333;             --accent-color: #007acc;             --border-color: #e0e0e0;             --tab-active-bg: #ffffff;             --tab-inactive-bg: #e8e8e8;             --tab-text: #666666;             --tab-text-active: #000000;             --scrollbar-bg: #ffffff;             --scrollbar-thumb: #c1c1c1;         }          * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }                  body {             font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;             background-color: var(--bg-color);             color: var(--text-color);             height: 100vh;             display: flex;             overflow: hidden;             transition: background 0.3s, color 0.3s;         }          /* Sidebar */         .sidebar {             width: 250px;             background-color: var(--sidebar-bg);             border-right: 1px solid var(--border-color);             display: flex;             flex-direction: column;             transition: background 0.3s;         }          .sidebar-header {             padding: 15px;             font-weight: bold;             font-size: 1.1rem;             display: flex;             justify-content: space-between;             align-items: center;             border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);         }          .file-explorer {             flex: 1;             overflow-y: auto;             padding: 10px;         }          .file-item {             padding: 8px 10px;             cursor: pointer;             border-radius: 4px;             display: flex;             align-items: center;             gap: 10px;             font-size: 0.9rem;             color: var(--tab-text);         }          .file-item:hover { background-color: var(--tab-inactive-bg); color: var(--text-color); }         .file-item.active { background-color: var(--accent-color); color: white; }         .file-item i { width: 16px; text-align: center; }          /* Main Editor Area */         .main-area {             flex: 1;             display: flex;             flex-direction: column;             position: relative;         }          /* Tabs */         .tabs-container {             display: flex;             background-color: var(--sidebar-bg);             border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);             height: 35px;         }          .tab {             padding: 0 15px;             display: flex;             align-items: center;             background-color: var(--tab-inactive-bg);             color: var(--tab-text);             cursor: pointer;             border-right: 1px solid var(--border-color);             font-size: 0.85rem;             min-width: 120px;             justify-content: space-between;         }          .tab.active {             background-color: var(--tab-active-bg);             color: var(--tab-text-active);             border-top: 2px solid var(--accent-color);         }          .tab-close { margin-left: 10px; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.2s; }         .tab:hover .tab-close { opacity: 1; }          /* Editor */         .editor-wrapper {             flex: 1;             position: relative;             overflow: hidden;         }          textarea#code-input {             position: absolute;             top: 0; left: 0;             width: 100%; height: 100%;             background: transparent;             color: transparent;             border: none;             resize: none;             padding: 10px;             font-family: 'Consolas', 'Monaco', 'Courier New', monospace;             font-size: 14px;             line-height: 1.5;             z-index: 10;             outline: none;             white-space: pre;             overflow-wrap: normal;             tab-size: 4;         }          /* The Highlight Layer */         pre {             position: absolute;             top: 0; left: 0;             width: 100%; height: 100%;             padding: 10px;             margin: 0;             font-family: 'Consolas', 'Monaco', 'Courier New', monospace;             font-size: 14px;             line-height: 1.5;             z-index: 1;             pointer-events: none; /* Let clicks pass through to textarea */             white-space: pre;             overflow-wrap: normal;         }          /* Toolbar */         .toolbar {             height: 40px;             background-color: var(--bg-color);             border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);             display: flex;             align-items: center;             padding: 0 15px;             gap: 15px;         }          .tool-btn {             background: none;             border: none;             color: var(--text-color);             cursor: pointer;             font-size: 1rem;             padding: 5px;             border-radius: 4px;             transition: background 0.2s;         }          .tool-btn:hover { background-color: var(--tab-inactive-bg); color: var(--accent-color); }         .tool-btn.active { color: var(--accent-color); }          .status-bar {             height: 25px;             background-color: var(--accent-color);             color: white;             display: flex;             align-items: center;             padding: 0 15px;             font-size: 0.8rem;             justify-content: space-between;         }          /* Scrollbar Styling */         ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 10px; height: 10px; }         ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: var(--scrollbar-bg); }         ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--scrollbar-thumb); border-radius: 5px; }         ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #555; }          /* Utility */         .hidden { display: none !important; }                  /* Prism Overrides for Editor */         .prism-line-numbers-rows { border-right: none !important; }         .token.comment, .token.prolog, .token.doctype, .token.cdata { color: #6a9955; }         .token.punctuation { color: #d4d4d4; }         [data-theme="light"] .token.comment, [data-theme="light"] .token.prolog, [data-theme="light"] .token.doctype, [data-theme="light"] .token.cdata { color: #999; }     </style> </head> <body>      <!-- Sidebar -->     <div class="sidebar">         <div class="sidebar-header">             <span><i class="fas fa-code"></i> DevNote Pro</span>             <button class="tool-btn" id="new-file-btn" title="New File"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i></button>         </div>         <div class="file-explorer" id="file-explorer">             <!-- Files injected by JS -->         </div>     </div>      <!-- Main Area -->     <div class="main-area">         <!-- Toolbar -->         <div class="toolbar">             <button class="tool-btn" id="theme-toggle" title="Toggle Theme"><i class="fas fa-moon"></i></button>             <button class="tool-btn" id="save-btn" title="Save File"><i class="fas fa-save"></i></button>             <button class="tool-btn" id="clear-btn" title="Clear"><i class="fas fa-trash"></i></button>             <button class="tool-btn" id="format-btn" title="Format Code"><i class="fas fa-align-left"></i></button>             <div style="flex:1"></div>             <span id="word-count" style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--tab-text);">0 words</span>         </div>          <!-- Tabs -->         <div class="tabs-container" id="tabs-container">             <!-- Tabs injected by JS -->         </div>          <!-- Editor -->         <div class="editor-wrapper">             <textarea id="code-input" spellcheck="false" placeholder="Type code here..."></textarea>             <pre><code id="code-display" class="language-javascript"></code></pre>         </div>          <!-- Status Bar -->         <div class="status-bar">             <span id="cursor-pos">Ln 1, Col 1</span>             <span id="file-name-display">Untitled</span>         </div>     </div>      <!-- PrismJS Scripts -->     <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/prism.min.js"></script>     <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/components/prism-javascript.min.js"></script>     <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/components/prism-css.min.js"></script>     <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/components/prism-html.min.js"></script>     <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/components/prism-python.min.js"></script>     <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/components/prism-java.min.js"></script>     <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/components/prism-c.min.js"></script>     <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/components/prism-cpp.min.js"></script>     <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/components/prism-json.min.js"></script>     <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/prism/1.29.0/plugins/line-numbers/prism-line-numbers.min.js"></script>      <script>         // --- State Management ---         const state = {             files: [                 { id: 1, name: 'index.html', language: 'html', content: '<!-- Welcome to DevNote Pro -->
<h1>Hello World</h1>
<p>Start typing to edit...</p>' },                 { id: 2, name: 'style.css', language: 'css', content: 'body {
  background: #1e1e1e;
  color: white;
}' },                 { id: 3, name: 'script.js', language: 'javascript', content: 'function init() {
  console.log("Ready!");
}' }             ],             activeFileId: 1,             theme: 'dark'         };          // --- DOM Elements ---         const els = {             fileExplorer: document.getElementById('file-explorer'),             tabsContainer: document.getElementById('tabs-container'),             codeInput: document.getElementById('code-input'),             codeDisplay: document.getElementById('code-display'),             wordCount: document.getElementById('word-count'),             cursorPos: document.getElementById('cursor-pos'),             fileNameDisplay: document.getElementById('file-name-display'),             themeToggle: document.getElementById('theme-toggle'),             saveBtn: document.getElementById('save-btn'),             clearBtn: document.getElementById('clear-btn'),             formatBtn: document.getElementById('format-btn'),             newFileBtn: document.getElementById('new-file-btn')         };          // --- Initialization ---         function init() {             renderFileExplorer();             renderTabs();             loadFile(state.activeFileId);             setupEventListeners();             updateCursorPos();                          // Auto-resize textarea             els.codeInput.addEventListener('input', () => {                 els.codeInput.style.height = 'auto';                 els.codeInput.style.height = (els.codeInput.scrollHeight) + 'px';                 updateCursorPos();             });         }          // --- Core Functions ---          function renderFileExplorer() {             els.fileExplorer.innerHTML = '';             state.files.forEach(file => {                 const div = document.createElement('div');                 div.className = `file-item ${file.id === state.activeFileId ? 'active' : ''}`;                 div.innerHTML = `<i class="fas ${getFileIcon(file.language)}"></i> ${file.name}`;                 div.onclick = () => openFile(file.id);                 els.fileExplorer.appendChild(div);             });         }          function renderTabs() {             els.tabsContainer.innerHTML = '';             state.files.forEach(file => {                 const tab = document.createElement('div');                 tab.className = `tab ${file.id === state.activeFileId ? 'active' : ''}`;                 tab.innerHTML = `                     <span><i class="fas ${getFileIcon(file.language)}"></i> ${file.name}</span>                     <span class="tab-close">&times;</span>                 `;                 tab.onclick = (e) => {                     if (e.target.classList.contains('tab-close')) {                         closeFile(file.id);                     } else {                         openFile(file.id);                     }                 };                 els.tabsContainer.appendChild(tab);             });         }          function openFile(id) {             state.activeFileId = id;             const file = state.files.find(f => f.id === id);             els.codeInput.value = file.content;             updateHighlight();             renderFileExplorer();             renderTabs();             updateStatus();         }          function closeFile(id) {             state.files = state.files.filter(f => f.id !== id);             if (state.activeFileId === id) {                 // If closing active file, switch to another or create new                 if (state.files.length > 0) {                     openFile(state.files[0].id);                 } else {                     createNewFile();                 }             }             renderFileExplorer();             renderTabs();         }          function createNewFile() {             const id = Date.now();             state.files.push({                 id: id,                 name: `untitled-${state.files.length + 1}.txt`,                 language: 'text',                 content: ''             });             openFile(id);         }          function loadFile(id) {             const file = state.files.find(f => f.id === id);             if (file) {                 els.codeInput.value = file.content;                 updateHighlight();                 updateStatus();             }         }          function updateHighlight() {             const content = els.codeInput.value;             els.codeDisplay.textContent = content;             Prism.highlightElement(els.codeDisplay);             updateWordCount();         }          function updateCursorPos() {             const text = els.codeInput.value;             const cursor = els.codeInput.selectionStart;             const lines = text.substring(0, cursor).split('
');             const currentLine = lines.length;             const currentCol = lines[lines.length - 1].length + 1;             els.cursorPos.textContent = `Ln ${currentLine}, Col ${currentCol}`;         }          function updateWordCount() {             const text = els.codeInput.value;             const words = text.trim() === '' ? 0 : text.trim().split(/\s+/).length;             els.wordCount.textContent = `${words} words`;         }          function updateStatus() {             const file = state.files.find(f => f.id === state.activeFileId);             els.fileNameDisplay.textContent = file ? file.name : 'No File Open';         }          function getFileIcon(lang) {             switch(lang) {                 case 'html': return 'fa-html5';                 case 'css': return 'fa-css3-alt';                 case 'javascript': return 'fa-js';                 case 'python': return 'fa-python';                 case 'java': return 'fa-java';                 case 'c': return 'fa-c';                 case 'cpp': return 'fa-file-code';                 case 'json': return 'fa-code';                 default: return 'fa-file-alt';             }         }          // --- Event Listeners ---          function setupEventListeners() {             // Theme Toggle             els.themeToggle.addEventListener('click', () => {                 state.theme = state.theme === 'dark' ? 'light' : 'dark';                 document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', state.theme);                 els.themeToggle.innerHTML = state.theme === 'dark' ? '<i class="fas fa-sun"></i>' : '<i class="fas fa-moon"></i>';             });              // Save (Simulated)             els.saveBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {                 const file = state.files.find(f => f.id === state.activeFileId);                 if(file) {                     file.content = els.codeInput.value;                     alert(`Saved ${file.name} to local storage (simulated)`);                 }             });              // Clear             els.clearBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {                 if(confirm('Are you sure you want to clear the current file?')) {                     const file = state.files.find(f => f.id === state.activeFileId);                     if(file) file.content = '';                     updateHighlight();                 }             });              // Format (Simple indentation fix)             els.formatBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {                 const lines = els.codeInput.value.split('
');                 const formatted = lines.map(line => {                     // Very basic indentation logic for demo                     const match = line.match(/^(\s*)/);                     return match ? match[1] + line.trim() : line;                 }).join('
');                 els.codeInput.value = formatted;                 updateHighlight();             });              // New File             els.newFileBtn.addEventListener('click', createNewFile);              // Input handling             els.codeInput.addEventListener('input', updateHighlight);             els.codeInput.addEventListener('keyup', updateCursorPos);             els.codeInput.addEventListener('click', updateCursorPos);             els.codeInput.addEventListener('select', updateCursorPos);         }          // Start App         init();      </script> </body> </html> ```  ### Features Included:  1.  **Syntax Highlighting:** Uses **Prism.js** (loaded via CDN) to colorize code in real-time. It supports HTML, CSS, JavaScript, Python, Java, C, C++, and JSON. 2.  **Line Numbers:** Integrated via Prism.js plugin. 3.  **Tab System:** You can open multiple files in tabs. Clicking a tab switches the editor view. 4.  **File Explorer:** A sidebar that lists your open files. 5.  **Theme Switcher:** A button in the toolbar toggles between a "Dark Mode" (VS Code style) and a "Light Mode". 6.  **Word Counter:** Displays the word count in the toolbar. 7.  **Cursor Position:** Displays Line and Column numbers in the status bar. 8.  **Tools:**     *   **Save:** Saves the content to the browser's memory (simulated).     *   **Clear:** Clears the current file.     *   **Format:** A basic formatter that aligns indentation.     *   **New File:** Creates a blank tab. 9.  **Responsive UI:** Uses Flexbox to ensure the editor takes up the full screen height.  ### How to use: 1.  Copy the code block above. 2.  Create a new file named `index.html` on your computer. 3.  Paste the code and save. 4.  Double-click `index.html` to open it in your browser.

